/E (Organisations that rely on manual evaluation of prospective clients often face challenges in efficiently identifying which leads are most likely to convert into high-value business relationships. Manual client evaluation tends to be time-consuming and does not scale well as the volume of prospective client data grows. )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
